  },
  {
   "t0": 122.43,
   "t1": 124.37,
   "text": "Cordyceps is a real fungus.",
   "line": "n1"
  },
  {
   "t0": 124.43,
   "t1": 126.73,
   "text": "In the forest, one kind infects ants.",
   "line": "n1"
  },
  {
   "t0": 128.15,
   "t1": 128.92,
   "text": "It doesn't bite.",
   "line": "n2"
  },
  {
   "t0": 128.97,
   "t1": 133.73,
   "text": "It grows: thin threads called hyphae, spreading through the body like roots through soil.",
   "line": "n2"
  },
  {
   "t0": 170.55,
   "t1": 172.35,
   "text": "Hey, buddy. It's me.",
   "line": "d02"
  },
  {
   "t0": 181.55,
   "t1": 183.69,
   "text": "Dinner Sunday? Mom's making soup.",
   "line": "d03"
  },
  {
   "t0": 184.35,
   "t1": 186.15,
   "text": "Yeah\u2026",
   "line": "d04"
  },
  {
   "t0": 206.55,
   "t1": 209.59,
   "text": "In infected ants, the fungus wraps around the muscles.",
   "line": "n3"
  },
  {
   "t0": 209.69,
   "t1": 211.67,
   "text": "The brain? Mostly left alone.",
   "line": "n3"
  },
  {
   "t0": 267.35,
   "t1": 269.15,
   "text": "Watch it!",
   "line": "d05"
  },
  {
   "t0": 289.35,
   "t1": 291.15,
   "text": "Hey! You okay?",
   "line": "d06"
  },
  {
   "t0": 304.45,
   "t1": 307.4,
   "text": "Then, around noon, the ant climbs a stem, bites a leaf\u2026",
   "line": "n4"
  },
  {
   "t0": 307.45,
   "t1": 310.41,
   "text": "and holds on. It never decided to.",
   "line": "n4"
  },
  {
   "t0": 340.25,
   "t1": 343.37,
   "text": "The good news: your body runs at thirty-seven degrees.",
   "line": "n5"
  },
  {
   "t0": 343.45,
   "t1": 346.01,
   "text": "Too hot for Cordyceps. In real life.",
   "line": "n5"
  },
  {
